title: Codex is followed from the session files it writes, with the model each session works with: one at work before the app started is where it was, and a new one is seen reading lines, searching and editing as its file grows, then leaves when done
folders: rust-small
fixtures: codex-home
codex: codex-home
prefs: {"codex": true}
limit: 90
expect-log: Codex is followed: the sessions it writes in
expect-log: an assistant \(Codex\) is on the canvas
expect-log: an assistant \(Codex\) works with gpt-5$
expect-log: an assistant \(Codex\) works with gpt-5.1-codex-max
forbid-log: script: agent needs
forbid-log: script: cannot append
forbid-log: are not watched

wait 3000
fit
wait 2500
mark one-at-work-before
wait 500
agent Explain how the steps are counted
wait 2500
mark following-the-one-before
wait 500
touch {FIX}/codex-home/sessions/2026/01/01/rollout-2026-01-01T11-00-00-01a1ec52-0000-7000-8000-000000000002.jsonl {"type":"session_meta","payload":{"id":"01a1ec52-0000-7000-8000-000000000002","cwd":"{FIX}/rust-small","originator":"codex_exec","cli_version":"0.169.0","source":"exec"}}
touch {FIX}/codex-home/sessions/2026/01/01/rollout-2026-01-01T11-00-00-01a1ec52-0000-7000-8000-000000000002.jsonl {"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_started","turn_id":"t1"}}
touch {FIX}/codex-home/sessions/2026/01/01/rollout-2026-01-01T11-00-00-01a1ec52-0000-7000-8000-000000000002.jsonl {"type":"turn_context","payload":{"cwd":"{FIX}/rust-small","model":"gpt-5.1-codex-max"}}
touch {FIX}/codex-home/sessions/2026/01/01/rollout-2026-01-01T11-00-00-01a1ec52-0000-7000-8000-000000000002.jsonl {"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"x","turn_id":"t1","item":{"type":"UserMessage","id":"item-1","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Make step ten return ten times more"}]}}}
wait 3000
agent Make step ten return ten times more
wait 500
touch {FIX}/codex-home/sessions/2026/01/01/rollout-2026-01-01T11-00-00-01a1ec52-0000-7000-8000-000000000002.jsonl {"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"x","turn_id":"t1","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-1","command":["powershell.exe","-Command","Get-Content src/steps.rs | Select-Object -Skip 29 -First 16"],"cwd":"file:///{FIX}/rust-small","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"Get-Content src/steps.rs | Select-Object -Skip 29 -First 16","name":"steps.rs","path":"src/steps.rs"}],"status":"completed","exit_code":0}}}
wait 3500
mark reading-a-range
wait 500
touch {FIX}/codex-home/sessions/2026/01/01/rollout-2026-01-01T11-00-00-01a1ec52-0000-7000-8000-000000000002.jsonl {"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","name":"exec","call_id":"call-2","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rg -n step_1 src/steps.rs\"}))"}}
wait 3500
mark searching
wait 500
touch {FIX}/codex-home/sessions/2026/01/01/rollout-2026-01-01T11-00-00-01a1ec52-0000-7000-8000-000000000002.jsonl {"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"x","turn_id":"t1","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-3","status":"completed","changes":{"{FIX}/rust-small/src/steps.rs":{"type":"update","move_path":null,"unified_diff":"@@ -37,3 +37,3 @@\u000a fn step_10() -> u32 {\u000a-    10\u000a+    100\u000a }\u000a"}}}}}
wait 3500
mark editing
wait 500
touch {FIX}/codex-home/sessions/2026/01/01/rollout-2026-01-01T11-00-00-01a1ec52-0000-7000-8000-000000000002.jsonl {"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","turn_id":"t1"}}
wait 9000
mark gone-when-done
wait 500
left settings:Codex
wait 1500
mark the-setting
wait 500
left settings:close
wait 300
quit
